  "grammar": [
    {
      "title": "Review: the end-of-sentence particles",
      "explain": "啊 (aa3) softens a question · 呢 (ne1) 'and what about…?' · 啦 (laa1) suggests or urges · 喇 (laa3) something has changed · 㗎 (gaa3) explains a fact, 'you know' · 喎 (wo3) passes on news or something you just noticed. 啦 (laa1) and 喇 (laa3) differ only in tone!",
      "after": "走",
      "examples": [
        {
          "en": "Let's eat! (suggestion)",
          "parts": [
